---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-paneles-solares" set:html={`
<section class="hero"><div class="heroin"><div><div class="crumb">Construcción / Paneles solares</div><div class="eyebrow">Dimensionado fotovoltaico</div><h1>¿Cuántos paneles necesitás y cuántos entran en tu techo?</h1><p class="lead">Cruzamos consumo, sol disponible, potencia y superficie. Así sabés qué sistema pedir antes de hablar con un instalador.</p><div class="pills"><span>Potencia instalada</span><span>Superficie necesaria</span><span>Cobertura estimada</span></div></div><div class="scene" aria-label="Techo con paneles solares"><div class="sun"></div><div class="roof"></div><div class="array" id="heroArray"></div><div class="tag"><small>Sistema recomendado</small><strong id="heroSystem">8 paneles</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="tool"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="kicker">Elegí el objetivo</div><h2>No todos necesitan cubrir el 100%</h2></div><p>Compará autoconsumo parcial, cobertura total, sistema híbrido y vivienda sin red.</p></div><div class="cases"><button class="case active" data-case="partial"><i>50</i><strong>Bajar la factura</strong><small>Cubrir cerca del 50%.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="full"><i>100</i><strong>Cubrir el consumo</strong><small>Objetivo anual cercano al 100%.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="hybrid"><i>+</i><strong>Híbrido con batería</strong><small>Red más respaldo ante cortes.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="offgrid"><i>×</i><strong>Vivienda sin red</strong><small>Paneles y batería para autonomía.</small></button></div>
<div class="workspace"><div class="panel form"><h3>Datos de consumo y techo</h3><p class="sub" id="caseCopy">Priorizamos autoconsumo diurno y una inversión inicial más baja.</p><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="consumption">Consumo mensual</label><input id="consumption" type="number" min="50" max="10000" value="350"><small>Está en tu factura, expresado en kWh.</small></div><div class="field"><label for="zone">Zona solar</label><select id="zone"><option value="3.5">Patagonia · 3,5 HSP</option><option value="4.5" selected>Buenos Aires / Litoral · 4,5 HSP</option><option value="5.2">Córdoba · 5,2 HSP</option><option value="5.8">Mendoza / Cuyo · 5,8 HSP</option><option value="6">NOA · 6 HSP</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="panel">Potencia por panel</label><select id="panel"><option value="400">400 Wp</option><option value="450" selected>450 Wp</option><option value="500">500 Wp</option><option value="550">550 Wp</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="roof">Techo útil sin sombras</label><input id="roof" type="number" min="2" max="1000" value="24"><small>Descontá bordes, equipos y zonas sombreadas.</small></div><div class="field"><label for="efficiency">Rendimiento del sistema</label><select id="efficiency"><option value=".75">75% · conservador</option><option value=".8" selected>80% · estándar</option><option value=".85">85% · óptimo</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="price">Precio de electricidad</label><input id="price" type="number" min="1" value="115"><small>$/kWh para estimar ahorro mensual.</small></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="calculate">Dimensionar sistema</button><button class="reset" id="reset">Reiniciar</button></div></div>
<aside class="panel result" aria-live="polite"><span class="badge" id="badge">Bajar la factura</span><div class="big" id="panels">4 paneles</div><div class="biglabel" id="system">1,8 kWp instalados</div><div class="meters"><div class="meter"><small>Generación</small><strong id="generation">194 kWh/mes</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Cobertura</small><strong id="coverage">55%</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Techo</small><strong id="area">7,8 m²</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Ahorro</small><strong id="savings">$22.356/mes</strong></div></div><div class="roofcheck"><div class="roofhead"><span id="fitText">Entra en el techo disponible</span><span id="fitPct">33% ocupado</span></div><div class="bar"><span id="roofBar"></span></div><small id="battery">Sistema on-grid: no requiere batería.</small></div><div class="tip" id="tip">La orientación norte y la ausencia de sombras entre las 9 y las 16 son tan importantes como la cantidad de paneles.</div></aside></div></div></section>
<section class="guide"><div class="wrap guide-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Antes del presupuesto</div><h2>Cuatro chequeos que cambian el proyecto</h2><p>El cálculo dimensiona. La visita técnica confirma estructura, orientación, protecciones y conexión.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>Superficie y sombras</b><span>Un panel ocupa cerca de 1,95 m²; dejá espacio para circulación y mantenimiento.</span></div><div class="step"><b>Orientación</b><span>En Argentina, el norte maximiza la producción anual. Este y oeste reparten mejor por horario.</span></div><div class="step"><b>Inversor</b><span>Debe acompañar la potencia del arreglo, la cantidad de strings y la instalación eléctrica.</span></div><div class="step"><b>Generación distribuida</b><span>Un sistema on-grid puede inyectar excedentes si cumple los requisitos de la distribuidora.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">Preguntas frecuentes</div><h2>Antes de subir al techo</h2><div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q">¿Cuánto ocupa cada panel?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Un panel residencial típico ocupa alrededor de 1,95 m². El diseño final necesita además separaciones, bordes y pasillos técnicos.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Necesito batería?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">No para un sistema on-grid. Sí para tener respaldo durante cortes o para una vivienda sin conexión a la red.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿La producción es igual todo el año?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">No. El resultado usa un promedio anual; invierno, nubosidad, temperatura, suciedad y sombras modifican la producción mensual.</div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-paneles-solares')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-paneles-solares');

(()=>{const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...root.querySelectorAll(s)],fmt=n=>Math.round(n).toLocaleString("es-AR");let active="partial";const targets={partial:.5,full:1,hybrid:.8,offgrid:1.2},copies={partial:"Priorizamos autoconsumo diurno y una inversión inicial más baja.",full:"Dimensionamos para acercarnos al 100% del consumo anual.",hybrid:"Sumamos batería para respaldo, manteniendo conexión a la red.",offgrid:"Sobredimensionamos para autonomía y días de menor producción."};function calculate(){const consumption=Math.max(1,+$("#consumption").value),hsp=+$("#zone").value,panelW=+$("#panel").value,roof=Math.max(1,+$("#roof").value),eff=+$("#efficiency").value,price=+$("#price").value,target=targets[active],need=consumption*target,perPanel=panelW/1000*hsp*30*eff,panels=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(need/perPanel)),generation=panels*perPanel,kwp=panels*panelW/1000,area=panels*1.95,coverage=generation/consumption*100,fit=area<=roof,batteryKwh=(consumption/30)*(active==="offgrid"?2:active==="hybrid"?.5:0);$("#panels").textContent=panels+" "+(panels===1?"panel":"paneles");$("#heroSystem").textContent=panels+" paneles";$("#system").textContent=Number(kwp.toFixed(2)).toLocaleString("es-AR")+" kWp instalados";$("#generation").textContent=fmt(generation)+" kWh/mes";$("#coverage").textContent=Math.round(coverage)+"%";$("#area").textContent=Number(area.toFixed(1)).toLocaleString("es-AR")+" m²";$("#savings").textContent="$"+fmt(Math.min(generation,consumption)*price)+"/mes";$("#fitText").textContent=fit?"Entra en el techo disponible":"No entra: faltan "+Number((area-roof).toFixed(1)).toLocaleString("es-AR")+" m²";$("#fitPct").textContent=Math.round(area/roof*100)+"% ocupado";$("#roofBar").style.width=Math.min(100,area/roof*100)+"%";$("#roofBar").style.background=fit?"#f2bd4b":"#ef7b72";$("#battery").textContent=batteryKwh?"Batería útil sugerida: "+Number(batteryKwh.toFixed(1)).toLocaleString("es-AR")+" kWh.":"Sistema on-grid: no requiere batería.";$("#tip").textContent=fit?"La orientación norte y la ausencia de sombras entre las 9 y las 16 son tan importantes como la cantidad de paneles.":"El techo limita el objetivo: probá paneles de mayor potencia o bajá la cobertura.";const arr=$("#heroArray");arr.innerHTML="";for(let i=0;i<Math.min(12,panels);i++)arr.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend","<i class='cell'></i>")}
$$("[data-case]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{active=b.dataset.case;$$("[data-case]").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===b));$("#badge").textContent=b.querySelector("strong").textContent;$("#caseCopy").textContent=copies[active];calculate()}));$$("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",calculate));$("#calculate").addEventListener("click",calculate);$("#reset").addEventListener("click",()=>{$("#consumption").value="350";$("#zone").value="4.5";$("#panel").value="450";$("#roof").value="24";$("#efficiency").value=".8";$("#price").value="115";$("[data-case=partial]").click()});$$(".faq-q").forEach(q=>q.addEventListener("click",()=>q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));calculate()})();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-paneles-solares{--blue:#174b7a;--blue2:#347d9f;--sun:#f2bd4b;--ink:#182334;--muted:#5e6a79;--line:#d9e2e5;--sky:#eaf6f9;--cream:#fff8e6;--green:#24705b;--mint:#d7eee5}.mockup-paneles-solares *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-paneles-solares{margin:0;font:16px/1.45 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fbfdfc}.mockup-paneles-solares button,.mockup-paneles-solares input,.mockup-paneles-solares select{font:inherit}.mockup-paneles-solares .head{height:74px;padding:0 max(24px,calc((100% - 1180px)/2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-paneles-solares .brand{font-weight:900;font-size:19px}.mockup-paneles-solares .brand b{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;margin-right:10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue);color:white}.mockup-paneles-solares .nav{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:750;color:#4d5967}.mockup-paneles-solares .search{border:1px solid var(--line);background:white;border-radius:11px;padding:10px 15px}.mockup-paneles-solares .hero{padding:55px 24px 62px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fafcf8 0 63%,#e7f5f7 63%)}.mockup-paneles-solares .heroin{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.mockup-paneles-solares .crumb{font-size:14px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:850}.mockup-paneles-solares .eyebrow{margin-top:27px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#a26b06;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-paneles-solares .hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,68px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:10px 0 20px;max-width:700px}.mockup-paneles-solares .lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:650px}.mockup-paneles-solares .pills{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.mockup-paneles-solares .pills span{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:white;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-paneles-solares .scene{min-height:350px;position:relative}.mockup-paneles-solares .sun{position:absolute;width:105px;height:105px;border-radius:50%;right:8%;top:7px;background:var(--sun);box-shadow:0 0 0 18px #f2bd4b22,0 0 0 36px #f2bd4b12}.mockup-paneles-solares .roof{position:absolute;left:2%;right:2%;bottom:30px;height:160px;background:#bc8a61;clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 42%,88% 100%,12% 100%,0 42%);filter:drop-shadow(0 22px 25px #38515b25)}.mockup-paneles-solares .array{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:86px;width:335px;height:180px;transform:translateX(-50%) perspective(500px) rotateX(53deg);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px;padding:7px;background:#1c3448;border:5px solid #172e42;box-shadow:0 22px 24px #172f4338}.mockup-paneles-solares .cell{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#397fa5,#174b7a);border:1px solid #8fc3d5;position:relative}.mockup-paneles-solares .cell:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:48% 0 auto;border-top:1px solid #ffffff4a}.mockup-paneles-solares .tag{position:absolute;left:0;top:34px;padding:12px 15px;border-radius:13px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 12px 25px #174b7a18}.mockup-paneles-solares .tag small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-paneles-solares .tag strong{font-size:21px;color:var(--blue)}
.mockup-paneles-solares .tool{padding:65px 24px}.mockup-paneles-solares .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto}.mockup-paneles-solares .sectionhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:23px}.mockup-paneles-solares .kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#a26b06;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-paneles-solares .sectionhead h2,.mockup-paneles-solares .guide h2,.mockup-paneles-solares .faq h2{font-size:37px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.mockup-paneles-solares .sectionhead p{max-width:510px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.mockup-paneles-solares .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:22px}.mockup-paneles-solares .case{min-height:108px;padding:17px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;background:white;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.mockup-paneles-solares .case i{font-style:normal;display:grid;place-items:center;width:33px;height:33px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--cream);color:#93620c;font-weight:900}.mockup-paneles-solares .case strong{display:block;margin:9px 0 3px}.mockup-paneles-solares .case small{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-paneles-solares .case.active{border:2px solid var(--sun);padding:16px;background:#fffbef;box-shadow:0 9px 22px #a26b0613}.mockup-paneles-solares .workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:20px}.mockup-paneles-solares .panel{padding:28px;border-radius:24px}.mockup-paneles-solares .form{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 16px 40px #17364a0d}.mockup-paneles-solares .panel h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-paneles-solares .sub{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.mockup-paneles-solares .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:17px}.mockup-paneles-solares .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-paneles-solares .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-paneles-solares .field small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}.mockup-paneles-solares input,.mockup-paneles-solares select{width:100%;min-height:50px;border:1px solid #cfdadd;border-radius:12px;background:white;padding:12px 14px;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-paneles-solares .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.mockup-paneles-solares .primary{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:white;padding:14px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.mockup-paneles-solares .reset{border:1px solid var(--sun);border-radius:12px;background:white;color:#6e5421;padding:13px 17px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-paneles-solares .result{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--blue),var(--blue2));color:white}.mockup-paneles-solares .result:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:250px;height:250px;border:46px solid #ffffff0b;border-radius:50%;right:-130px;bottom:-120px}.mockup-paneles-solares .badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--mint);color:#174f40;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-paneles-solares .big{font-size:54px;font-weight:950;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:14px 0 3px}.mockup-paneles-solares .biglabel{color:#dcecf2;font-size:14px}.mockup-paneles-solares .meters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px;margin:22px 0}.mockup-paneles-solares .meter{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:14px 11px;border:1px solid #ffffff2d;background:#ffffff0e;border-radius:14px}.mockup-paneles-solares .meter small{display:block;color:#dcebf1;font-size:11px}.mockup-paneles-solares .meter strong{font-size:17px}.mockup-paneles-solares .roofcheck{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:16px;border:1px solid #ffffff28;background:#ffffff0f;border-radius:15px}.mockup-paneles-solares .roofhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-paneles-solares .bar{height:11px;margin:12px 0 7px;border-radius:20px;background:#ffffff2e;overflow:hidden}.mockup-paneles-solares .bar span{display:block;height:100%;width:60%;border-radius:20px;background:var(--sun)}.mockup-paneles-solares .tip{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-top:16px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--cream);color:#59492d;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.mockup-paneles-solares .guide{padding:70px 24px;background:#f2f7f5}.mockup-paneles-solares .guide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:44px}.mockup-paneles-solares .guide p{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-paneles-solares .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.mockup-paneles-solares .step{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:white}.mockup-paneles-solares .step b{display:block;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-paneles-solares .step span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-paneles-solares .faq{padding:70px 24px}.mockup-paneles-solares .faq-item{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-paneles-solares .faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 0;border:0;background:none;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-paneles-solares .faq-a{display:none;max-width:820px;padding:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-paneles-solares .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.mockup-paneles-solares .foot{padding:30px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:white;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:880px){.mockup-paneles-solares .nav{display:none}.mockup-paneles-solares .heroin,.mockup-paneles-solares .workspace,.mockup-paneles-solares .guide-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-paneles-solares .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-paneles-solares .sectionhead{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}}@media(max-width:540px){.mockup-paneles-solares .cases,.mockup-paneles-solares .fields,.mockup-paneles-solares .steps,.mockup-paneles-solares .meters{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-paneles-solares .hero h1{font-size:44px}.mockup-paneles-solares .array{width:285px}.mockup-paneles-solares .actions{flex-direction:column}}

.mockup-paneles-solares { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-paneles-solares .top, .mockup-paneles-solares header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-paneles-solares .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-paneles-solares .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-paneles-solares .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-paneles-solares .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-paneles-solares .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-paneles-solares .support-real p { color:#52657b; line-height:1.65; }
/* Prevent the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text
   designed to inherit a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-paneles-solares :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td) { color:inherit; }
.mockup-paneles-solares input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance:textfield; appearance:textfield; }
.mockup-paneles-solares input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, .mockup-paneles-solares input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-paneles-solares .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-paneles-solares support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
